\draw (2.2,1.8) circle (1.3);
\draw (3.8,1.8) circle (1.3);
\node at (1.5,3.3) {$A$};
\node at (4.5,3.3) {$B$};
\node[anchor=north west] at (0.1,3.7) {$\xi$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

b. Shade everything in the sample space outside $A$, including the part of $B$ outside $A$.
